  "Title": "Automatic Generation of Differential Expression Analyses",
  "Description": "Implements pipelines for generating differential\nexpression analysis reports in the augere framework. This\nincludes analyses with edgeR or voom-limma, with a variety of\noptions for contrasts, blocking and covariates. Each pipeline\nfunction generates a self-contained Rmarkdown report with all\nof the steps required to reproduce the DE analysis.",
